      "line_end": 26,
      "title": "New delete and purge routes have no tests",
      "description": "This change adds two routes with new auth and error paths. No test file in the repository exercises these routes. Regressions in authorization or the purge error handling can ship unnoticed. Add tests for the auth rejection, the unknown id case and the purge count.",
